        "ImageDescription": {
          "value": "<p>SVG path with two <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/SVG/Element/marker\">markers</a> using the attributes marker-start and marker-end\n</p>\nIn the former version the left arrow head was rendered in the PNG, but not shown in the browser. Problem solved here: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/43575809\">http://stackoverflow.com/questions/43575809</a>",
