        "ImageDescription": {
          "value": "<p>SVG path with the same <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/SVG/Element/marker\">marker</a> at both ends\n</p><p>The marker itself has <code>orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"</code> and is added to the path with <code>marker-start</code> and <code>marker-end</code>.\n</p><p>The generation of the correct PNG is unreliable. The SVG itself looks correct in Firefox and Chrome.\n</p>\nBased on a proposal at <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/43575809\">http://stackoverflow.com/questions/43575809</a>",
          "source": "commons-desc-page"
